      "items": [
        "AuthN: email magic-link, API tokens, self-hosted bootstrap (B0.1)",
        "Organizations/tenants: membership, roles, invitations (B0.2)",
        "CSRF on every new B0.1/B0.2 mutating route",
        "AUTH_MODE=none: zero new surface, the permanent self-hosted default (ADR-004)",
        "Every service (auth, orgs, repos, background workers) reads/writes the one SQLite file directly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Planned, not yet built (B0.3-B0.7)",
      "items": [
