        "Rate-limiting middleware beyond the B0.1 login endpoint -- B0.5",
        "Mandatory (not opt-in) sandboxing for tenant-supplied code -- B0.6",
        "Encrypted secret storage + GitHub App architecture (ADR-001) -- B0.7"
      ]
    }
